LangString installingWebview2 ${LANG_SWAHILI} "Inasakinisha WebView2..."
LangString newerVersionInstalled ${LANG_SWAHILI} "Toleo jipya zaidi la ${PRODUCTNAME} tayari limesakinishwa! Haipendekezi kusakinisha toleo la zamani. Ikiwa unataka kusakinisha toleo hili la zamani, ni bora kusanidua toleo la sasa kwanza. Chagua operesheni unayotaka kufanya na ubofye Ijayo ili kuendelea."
LangString older ${LANG_SWAHILI} "mzee"
LangString olderOrUnknownVersionInstalled ${LANG_SWAHILI} "Toleo la $R4 la ${PRODUCTNAME} limesakinishwa kwenye mfumo wako. Inapendekezwa kwamba uondoe toleo la sasa kabla ya kusakinisha. Chagua operesheni unayotaka kufanya na ubofye Ijayo ili kuendelea."
LangString silentDowngrades ${LANG_SWAHILI} "Kushusha daraja kumezimwa kwa kisakinishi hiki, haiwezi kuendelea na kisakinishaji kimya, tafadhali tumia kisakinishi cha kiolesura cha picha badala yake.$\n"
LangString unableToUninstall ${LANG_SWAHILI} "Imeshindwa kusanidua!"
LangString uninstallApp ${LANG_SWAHILI} "Ondoa ${PRODUCTNAME}"
